<title>USA: Ambac says it has no losses from auto loans.</title>
<headline>Ambac says it has no losses from auto loans.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Inc said Friday it has no exposure to any of the sub-prime automobile financing companies, including Jayhawk Acceptance Corp and Mercury Finance Co.</p>
<p>The company also said none of the state funds advised by its Cadre Financial Services Inc unit have any Jayhawk or Mercury holdings.</p>
<p>Jayhawk filed for bankruptcy on Thursday, while Mercury recently said it was unable to refinance a total of $61 million in commercial paper.</p>
</text>
